  "published": "2026-01-15T13:11:21.433Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Additions:\nadd custom equaltiy to cwltype and mutually recursive types\nadd missing properties to main wf of run, expand tests\nchange naming and use static members for property names\nwrite creators and dateCreated to WorkflowProtocol as well\nadd checks for mandatory parent profile fields\noptionally allow skipping broken runs and worklows for RO-Crate conversion\nset dataplant as workflow publisher during conversion\nchange name to take from titel to match mapping file\ntake name and description from run/wf, make license mandatory\nadd automatic workflow and run profile export\nadd files and workflow to hasParts during run conversion\nadd workflow to hasParts of workflow in conversion\nadd mainEntity during conversion to rocrate run\nUnify CWL type system with mutual recursion and Union support\nallow empty outputs, cleanup\nAdd support for records\nadd list decoding/encoding for source in inputStep\nadd decoders to processing units\nbump yamlicious version for multiline doc handling\nupdate logo\nRename tests DataMap to Datamap in Tests\nDeletions:\nremove print\nadd main entityCheck and fallback for executingLabProtocol during run decomposition\nDelete duplicate tests/TestingUtils/Descriptions.fs\nBugfixes:\nfix description exected newlines\nadd fixes for cwl doc and label reading",
